{"seq":1,"slug":"life-and-times","title":"史蒂夫·乔布斯·生平与时代","stage":"DONE","category":"steve-jobs","categoryLabel":"史蒂夫·乔布斯","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/life-and-times","rating":{"composite":3.78,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/32_steve-jobs/1_life-and-times","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"史蒂夫-乔布斯的生平与时代\">史蒂夫·乔布斯的生平与时代</h1><p>史蒂夫·乔布斯（Steve Jobs，1955—2011）是数字时代最具影响力也最具传奇色彩的人物之一。他并非工程师出身，却以非凡的产品直觉、对完美的偏执与重塑行业的远见，深刻改变了个人电脑、动画电影、音乐、手机与平板等多个领域。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷的定位-时间线-而非主题\">本卷的定位：时间线，而非主题</h2><p>「乔布斯」这一专题被拆为六个 hub。本卷（生平与时代）是<strong>唯一按编年顺序</strong>组织的一卷，回答的是「他的一生何时、按什么次序发生了什么」。它是阅读其余五卷的时间地图——其他卷都按主题切片，不重复完整年表。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>兄弟 hub</th>\n<th>它回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本卷的分工</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>他做出了哪些改变世界的东西</td>\n<td>本卷只交代产品「何时」诞生，技术与设计在那里展开</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>他如何思考、如何领导</td>\n<td>本卷只叙事，因果与方法论在那里剖析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">代表成就</a></td>\n<td>哪些作品最能代表他</td>\n<td>本卷给时间坐标，单品细读在那里</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>他身后留下了什么</td>\n<td>本卷止于 2011，长期影响在那里</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>该如何评价他</td>\n<td>本卷如实陈述事实（含延误治疗等），价值判断在那里</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p>按章节顺序通读即可——这是本卷的设计意图：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;① 早年与创业&lt;br/&gt;1955-1985&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;② 放逐与回归&lt;br/&gt;1985-2000&quot;] --&gt; C[&quot;③ 第二幕与终章&lt;br/&gt;2001-2011&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"① 早年与创业&lt;br/&gt;1955-1985\"] --&gt; B[\"② 放逐与回归&lt;br/&gt;1985-2000\"] --&gt; C[\"③ 第二幕与终章&lt;br/&gt;2001-2011\"]</pre><ol>\n<li><strong>第一章 · 早年与创业</strong>：<a href=\"early-life-and-founding/adoption-childhood-and-reed-college\">身世、童年与里德学院</a> → <a href=\"early-life-and-founding/founding-apple-with-wozniak\">与沃兹尼亚克创立苹果</a></li>\n<li><strong>第二章 · 放逐与回归</strong>：<a href=\"exile-and-return/ousted-next-and-pixar\">被逐、NeXT 与皮克斯</a> → <a href=\"exile-and-return/the-return-that-saved-apple\">拯救苹果的回归</a></li>\n<li><strong>第三章 · 第二幕与终章</strong>：<a href=\"second-act-and-final-years/the-ipod-iphone-revolution\">iPod、iPhone 与 iPad 革命</a> → <a href=\"second-act-and-final-years/illness-and-death\">疾病与离世</a></li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>前置知识</strong>：无需任何技术背景，面向一般读者。若想先建立产品概念，可先浏览 <a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a>；若关心评价立场，建议读完本卷再进入 <a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a>，以免脱离事实语境。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一条贯穿全卷的主线\">一条贯穿全卷的主线</h2><p>乔布斯的传记之所以扣人心弦，在于它是一个关于<strong>创造、失败、放逐与回归</strong>的完整弧线：车库里的崛起、被自己公司驱逐的羞辱、NeXT 与皮克斯的蛰伏、力挽狂澜的回归，直至 iPhone 把苹果送上巅峰，终以一场克制而沉重的告别收尾。理解他的生平，就是理解一个把科技与人文、商业与艺术熔于一炉的复杂灵魂，如何在数字时代留下不可磨灭的印记。本卷力求以平实而立体的笔触，还原一个真实的乔布斯——既不神化，也不矮化。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"early-life-and-founding","title":"早年与创立苹果","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/life-and-times/early-life-and-founding","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"adoption-childhood-and-reed-college","title":"身世、童年与里德学院","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/life-and-times/early-life-and-founding/adoption-childhood-and-reed-college"},{"seq":2,"slug":"founding-apple-with-wozniak","title":"与沃兹尼亚克创立苹果","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/life-and-times/early-life-and-founding/founding-apple-with-wozniak"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"exile-and-return","title":"放逐与回归","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/life-and-times/exile-and-return","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ousted-next-and-pixar","title":"被逐、NeXT 与皮克斯","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/life-and-times/exile-and-return/ousted-next-and-pixar"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-return-that-saved-apple","title":"拯救苹果的回归","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/life-and-times/exile-and-return/the-return-that-saved-apple"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"second-act-and-final-years","title":"第二幕与最后岁月","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/life-and-times/second-act-and-final-years","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-ipod-iphone-revolution","title":"iPod、iPhone 与 iPad 革命","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/life-and-times/second-act-and-final-years/the-ipod-iphone-revolution"},{"seq":2,"slug":"illness-and-death","title":"疾病与离世","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/life-and-times/second-act-and-final-years/illness-and-death"}]}]}